# Slices 5+6+7 (Layer A density v2) fixture for 21-fixpoint-factorial.
# Builds on v1.5 (IF) by adding:
#   - Slice 5: compact LAM params `[recurse:factT n:intT]` synthesizes
#     two PRCs at emit time, removing the explicit `recurse PRC ...` and
#     `n PRC "n" intT` declarations.
#   - Slice 6: subsumed by Slice 2 (PLT.literal already accepts inline
#     literals — exercised by IF's expansion).
#   - Slice 7: anonymous `_` id + `@last` reference. The `_ APP sub ...`
#     line declares an anonymous IntLit-minus expression; `recCall` refers
#     to it via `@last`.
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 21-fixpoint-factorial.json's.
@v=1 root=app
factT FNT [intT] intT
nIsZero APP eqInt [n 0]
_ APP sub [n 1]
recCall APP recurse [@last]
mulBody APP mul [n recCall]
matchBody IF nIsZero 1 mulBody
bodyLam LAM [recurse:factT n:intT] matchBody
fact FIX factT bodyLam
app APP fact [5]
